(7276377, 1132828, 70265, '<td valign="top">this has an eerie feel that is enhanced by the dark shadows and bluetone processing. I usually don''t favor slight tilts, but it works well here. DOF perfect. A top pick for me, hope it does well!</td>', 'this has an eerie feel that is enhanced by the dark shadows and bluetone processing. I usually don''t favor slight tilts, but it works well here. DOF perfect. A top pick for me, hope it does well!', '2014-10-23 09:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
